==Battleground==
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 80~120 seconds<sup>2,400f~3,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Rathian (Enemy)|Rathian]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 50~66.67 seconds<sup>1,500f~2,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

